      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agreed on all points, thanks for checking it against the source. I\u0027ve raised https://github.com/lfreleng-actions/lftools-uv/issues/1043 for a distinct not-found exit status or rtd project-exists / project-version-exists commands, so callers can stop matching the message. Patch set 5 also makes tox pin the same exact version as lf-env.sh (see the tox.ini replies), so every caller runs the wording this matches.",
